// MW3 "Scorched Earth" get-up viewmodel animation - MW3-style playback.
// berlin_sgt_down_recovery_vm re-exported WITH tag_player. Models ripped from MW3 (Greyhound):
//   viewhands_player_delta_dirty = the tag_player NODE (animates, the player links to it)
//   viewhands_delta_dirty        = the first-person viewmodel arms (SetViewModel)
// GDT: source_data/_reapy/recovery.gdt   |   BINs: model_export/_reapy/recovery/, xanim_export/_reapy/recovery/
//
// Mechanism (_recovery.gsc): PlayerLinkToDelta the player to the node's tag_player; the node plays the
// clip via the camera-less cin_recovery_fp scene bundle. Materials are NOT cabled yet (PoC) - the arms
// render with a default material until the 3 mtl_viewmodel_delta_* materials are added.

scriptparsetree,scripts/zm/_recovery.gsc
scriptparsetree,scripts/zm/_recovery.csc

weapon,berlin_recovery

xanim,berlin_sgt_down_recovery_vm

scriptbundle,cin_recovery_fp
